// Article 5. Withdrawal.
#require "1-members.charter".
Var book-value : USD
Fact withdrawing Identified by person
Act give-notice Actor member
  Holds when True
  Creates withdrawing(member)
Power buy-out Actor company Recipient person
  Valid when Held(withdrawing(person)) For 90 days
  Creates buyout-due(company, person, MulDivRound(book-value,
              9 * capital(person), 10 * total-capital, Floor))
        , capital(person, 0)
  Terminates member(person), withdrawing(person)
Duty buyout-due Holder company Claimant person Related to usd
  Due within 60 days
  Terminated by pay-buyout
Act pay-buyout Actor company Recipient person Related to usd
  Creates cash(cash - usd)

Clause 5.1 => give-notice, withdrawing
Clause 5.2 => book-value, buy-out
Clause 5.3 => buyout-due, pay-buyout.
